      "tohave":[
         "'Though there is the verb 'to have' (иметь) in Russian, it is not often used for possession. Use the the phrase У меня есть ‘I have’; literally  ‘By me there is’\\nThis is the preposition y (at) followed by the genitive, plus the word есть (is/are), plus the possessed object at the nominative.",
         "\\n\\n\\n'У вас есть багаж? Do you have luggage?",
